**Key Insight:** Since `lcm(a, b) = a * b / gcd(a, b)`, and `lcm(a, b) ≤ threshold`, only values ≤ threshold can participate in any edge. Values > threshold can never have an LCM ≤ threshold with any other value (since `lcm(a, b) ≥ max(a, b)`).

